      "documentId": "resume-java-platform",
      "text": "Built Java 21 and Spring Boot services with REST APIs and MySQL transactions.\n\nImplemented RabbitMQ transactional outbox, publisher confirms, idempotency, and retry handling.\n\nAdded Micrometer metrics, correlation IDs, and Testcontainers integration tests.\n\nDeployed the service with Docker Compose for local demonstrations.",
